.env
.DS_Store
*.log
.superpowers/

# Local safety copies of the Supabase-hosted media meta.json. Kept on disk on
# purpose — meta.json lives in Supabase storage, not in this repo, and a
# full-overwrite once cost 200+ entries (recovered 2026-07-19). Snapshot before
# every meta.json write; edits must MERGE, never replace. Not committed: they are
# large data dumps that would churn the history.
meta-backup-*.json
meta-RESTORED-*.json

# Thumbnail snapshots taken before a bulk regeneration (~55MB).
thumb-backup-*/

# Working notes for content passes.
RIFE_*.md
